Conclusion
Congratulations! You have successfully completed Lab 7: Configure Static Routing for Traffic Management. In this comprehensive lab, you have:

Key Accomplishments:

Mastered VirtualService Configuration: You learned how to create and configure VirtualService resources to define sophisticated routing rules for microservices communication.

Implemented Path-Based Routing: You successfully configured routing rules based on HTTP paths, enabling you to direct traffic to specific service versions based on URL patterns.

Configured Header-Based Routing: You implemented advanced routing strategies using HTTP headers, allowing for user segmentation, canary deployments, and A/B testing scenarios.

Tested Traffic Distribution: You validated your routing configurations through comprehensive testing, ensuring that traffic flows correctly to intended service versions.

